  "content_description": "Recognition Action Item",
  "content_text_body": "The goal is to recognize one piece of exceptional work each week.\n\nAsk your team to send you their nominations throughout the week. Review them all by the end of the week and pick the week's spotlight team member. \n\nAsk the person who nominated the employee you selected to deliver the \"thank you\u00e2\u20ac\u009d during your next team discussion or do it as a quick stand-up meeting.",
